            text: _("Another poor soul claimed by the spreading darkness. At least her sacrifice was not in vain: we’ve had sufficient time to gather most of the region’s farmers and woodsmen. They’re not trained for battle, but will benefit greatly from your leadership, Deoran."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_89",
