      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_85",
        on: "branch_if_85",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "companion_id",
            equals: "Mari",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Look there! The undead army has broken through Captain Mari’s lines! I had almost dared to hope... but alas, she is lost."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("It takes one hell of a soldier to keep on fighting’ after losin’ an arm. I wish I’d gotten to know ’er better. Now I’ll never get the chance."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_86",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_87",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_88",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_89",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Gerrick",
            text: _("Aye... I’ve got most o’ the civilians safe underground in th’ cellars, with our trapdoor shut an’ barred. If we’re lucky, we can clean up this mess without any more gettin’ hurt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Captain Mari bought us time — I only hope it was enough. A mighty battle is upon us, but as surely as the dawn breaks after every night, the courage and valor of men will prevail over the wicked creatures of darkness."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("We must stand fast against the undead and defend our homes! We fight for the fallen! We fight for Wesnoth!"),
          },
        ],
      },
