            file: "siege_of_laurelmor.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("Mebrin! This has gone far enough."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("Ethiliel, my student... How pleased am I to see you again! What wonderful secrets have I to share..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("I have touched the void at the heart of all things, and I have begun to probe the mystic arts far beyond what any living elf knows. There is infinity at the brink of death, Ethiliel... If you thought me wise before, I have now become omniscient!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("You’ve become <b><i>evil</i></b>, Mebrin. Surely you see it! Take a good look at yourself! Your servants are abominations worse than any human. They stink of death, tainted magic and... and corruption! Even you! Mebrin... you were the kindest and gentlest of the sages..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("No, the sage Mebrin is dead. You’re not the master I once revered. I have come to cleanse your soul and put you to rest, my beloved teacher."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("Is that why you returned? Bah, I see you still have much foolishness to be rid of. I shall deal with you personally. You were always more of a hands-on learner, after all..."),
          },
          {
