            equals: "$( 13 + 2 )",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("Why do you aid these fools, Ethiliel? Join me! Stand by my side! The race of man shall be stricken off the face of the green world. Their corpses will serve us! Their bones will dance for our pleasure! We’ll make humanity into the mindless slaves that they all deserve to be!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ethiliel",
            text: _("And when that’s done, what will us elves have become? Naught but hungering shadows, devouring all we once cherished."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("Even a mere human can see that you have become a mockery of all that you once believed in, Mebrin of the elves. We will destroy you and bury your perverse corruption!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mebrin",
            text: _("Ethiliel I respect, but you? Destroy me? Your man-flesh will provide a fine feast for my ghouls, and once they’re through, your bones will serve me forever in undeath!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_135",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Deoran",
            text: _("At long last, it is done."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
